<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Industrial Catalogue | {{ specs.part_name }}</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap');

        :root {
            --primary: #1e3a8a; /* deep blue */
            --secondary: #3b82f6; /* bright blue */
            --accent: #ef4444; /* red for critical */
            --success: #10b981; /* green */
            --bg-body: #f1f5f9;
            --bg-card: #ffffff;
            --text-dark: #1e293b;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-body);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* HEADER */
        .header {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; }
        .header p { margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px; color: #cbd5e1; }

        /* CONTENT */
        .content { padding: 50px 60px; }

        /* SECTIONS */
        .section { margin-bottom: 50px; }
        .section-title {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 24px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--secondary);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        /* GRIDS & CARDS */
        .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; }
        .grid-4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
        .card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .card h4 { margin-top: 0; color: var(--secondary); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 5px; }

        /* TABLES */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        th, td {
            padding: 14px 16px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        th { background-color: #f8fafc; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; width: 35%; }
        
        .table-full th { background-color: var(--primary); color: white; width: auto; font-weight: 600; }
        .table-full tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f8fafc; }
        .table-full td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }

        /* UTILS */
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            background: var(--secondary);
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }
        .badge.outline { background: transparent; color: var(--secondary); border: 1px solid var(--secondary); }
        .badge.success { background: var(--success); }
        .badge.critical { background: var(--accent); }

        .highlight { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
        .text-success { color: var(--success); font-weight: 700; }
        
        ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 10px 0; }
        li { margin-bottom: 8px; }

        /* PRICING BLOCK */
        .kpi-block { text-align: center; background: #eff6ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; }
        .kpi-value { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); }
        .kpi-label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }

        /* FOOTER */
        .footer {
            background: var(--text-dark);
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>{{ specs.part_name }}</h1>
        <p>Complete Industrial AI Catalogue | Generated: {{ generated_date }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">

        <!-- 1. Executive Summary -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">1. Executive Summary</h2>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <h4>Overview</h4>
                    <p>The <strong>{{ specs.part_name }}</strong> (Ref: {{ specs.part_id }}) is a highly specialized industrial unit designed for rigorous technical environments. It leverages AI-optimized supply chaining and predictive maintenance models to ensure peak operational reliability.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h4>Key Value Proposition</h4>
                    <p>By securing <strong>{{ nego.winner }}</strong> as the main supplier and projecting over a {{ tco.horizon_years }}-year horizon, this deployment achieves a <strong>Total Adjusted Cost of ${{ tco.inflation_adjusted_total_usd | int }}</strong> globally, boasting an extraordinary <span class="text-success">{{ bp.financials.roi_percent }}% ROI</span>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Product Overview -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">2. Product Overview</h2>
            <p><strong>Name:</strong> {{ specs.part_name }}</p>
            <p><strong>Description:</strong> High-pressure industrial component engineered natively through {{ cad.cad_software }} generation scripts to guarantee absolute structural integrity and interoperability.</p>
            <p><strong>Use Case:</strong> Fluid control, high-pressure environments, or continuous manufacturing lines requiring exact tolerance handling.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Technical Specifications -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">3. Technical Specifications</h2>
            <table>
                <tr><th>Component ID</th><td>{{ specs.part_id }}</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Material</th><td>{{ specs.material }}</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Nominal Diameter</th><td>{{ specs.diameter_mm }} mm</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Total Weight</th><td>{{ specs.weight_kg }} kg</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Pressure Rating</th><td>{{ specs.pressure_bar }} bar</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Tolerances</th><td>&plusmn; {{ specs.tolerance_mm }} mm</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Max Temperature</th><td>{{ specs.temperature_max_celsius }} &deg;C</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Max Flow Rate</th><td>{{ specs.flow_rate_m3h }} m&sup3;/h</td></tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. CAD & Engineering Assets -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">4. CAD & Engineering Assets</h2>
            <p>The engineering team has successfully compiled and tested all digital models. Formats are ready for digital integration or CNC manufacturing.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>DXF Format:</strong> <code>{{ cad.dxf_path }}</code> &mdash; Standard 2D schematics for precise laser cutting and mapping.</li>
                <li><strong>IFC/STEP Format:</strong> <code>{{ cad.step_path | default(cad.ifc_path) | default('valve_model.step') }}</code> &mdash; Native 3D format for Building Information Modeling (BIM) collision testing.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Suppliers Analysis -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">5. Suppliers Analysis</h2>
            <table class="table-full">
                <tr>
                    <th>Rank</th>
                    <th>Supplier Name</th>
                    <th>Location</th>
                    <th>Price ($/kg)</th>
                    <th>Lead Time</th>
                    <th>Reliability Score</th>
                </tr>
                {% for supplier in sourcing.top_suppliers %}
                <tr {% if supplier.name == nego.winner %}style="background-color: #d1fae5;"{% endif %}>
                    <td>#{{ supplier.rank }}</td>
                    <td><strong>{{ supplier.name }}</strong></td>
                    <td>{{ supplier.country_name }}</td>
                    <td>${{ supplier.price_per_kg_usd }}</td>
                    <td>{{ supplier.lead_time_days }} days</td>
                    <td>{{ supplier.reliability_score }}/100</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Negotiation Results -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">6. Negotiation Results</h2>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div>
                    <p>The AI Agent conducted multiple negotiation rounds evaluating price, quantities, and delivery compensation. The definitive winner is <strong class="text-success">{{ nego.winner }} ({{ nego.winner_country }})</strong>.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Initial Price:</strong> ${{ nego.initial_price_per_kg }} / kg</li>
                        <li><strong>Final Negotiated Price:</strong> <span class="text-success">${{ nego.final_price_per_kg }}</span> / kg</li>
                        <li><strong>Total Discount:</strong> {{ nego.discount_percent }}%</li>
                        <li><strong>Contract Delivery Time:</strong> {{ nego.delivery_days }} days</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="kpi-block">
                    <div class="kpi-label">Final Volume Contract</div>
                    <div class="kpi-value">{{ nego.contract_quantity_kg }} kg</div>
                    <div class="kpi-label" style="margin-top: 10px;">Cost of Materials</div>
                    <div class="kpi-value" style="font-size:24px;">${{ nego.total_material_cost_usd | int }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <br>
            <p><strong>Supplier Choice Justification:</strong> The selected supplier achieved the highest overall efficiency score. The AI negotiated a substantial discount while locking down a secure and verifiable shipping schedule suited perfectly to local constraints.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Cost Analysis (TCO) -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">7. Cost Analysis (TCO - {{ tco.horizon_years }} Years)</h2>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <h4>Direct Procurement</h4>
                    <table>
                        <tr><th>Quantity</th><td>{{ tco.quantity_units }} units</td></tr>
                        <tr><th>Unit Cost</th><td>${{ tco.unit_cost_usd }}</td></tr>
                        <tr><th>Purchase Total</th><td>${{ tco.total_purchase_usd | int }}</td></tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h4>Lifetime Operations</h4>
                    <table>
                        <tr><th>Maintenances ({{ tco.horizon_years }}y)</th><td>${{ tco.maintenance_10y_usd | int }}</td></tr>
                        <tr><th>Energy Usage ({{ tco.horizon_years }}y)</th><td>${{ tco.energy_10y_usd | int }}</td></tr>
                        <tr><th>Inflation Rate</th><td>{{ tco.inflation_rate_dz_percent }}%</td></tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-block" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <div class="kpi-label">Inflation Adjusted Total Cost of Ownership (USD)</div>
                <div class="kpi-value">${{ tco.inflation_adjusted_total_usd | int }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Business Plan -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">8. Business Plan</h2>
            <div class="grid-4" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
                    <h4 style="border:none;">ROI</h4>
                    <div class="text-success" style="font-size:20px; font-weight:700;">{{ bp.financials.roi_percent }}%</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
                    <h4 style="border:none;">NPV</h4>
                    <div style="font-size:20px; font-weight:700;">${{ bp.financials.npv_usd | int }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
                    <h4 style="border:none;">Break Even</h4>
                    <div style="font-size:20px; font-weight:700;">{{ bp.financials.break_even_months }} mo</div>
                </div>
                <div class="card" style="text-align:center;">
                    <h4 style="border:none;">Y1 Margin</h4>
                    <div style="font-size:20px; font-weight:700;">{{ bp.financials.margin_percent_year1 }}%</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h4>3-Year Financial Projections</h4>
            <table class="table-full">
                <tr><th>Year</th><th>Gross Revenue</th><th>Operating Costs</th><th>Net Profit</th></tr>
                <tr><td>Year 1</td><td>${{ bp.financials.revenue_year1_usd | int }}</td><td>${{ bp.financials.costs_year1_usd | int }}</td><td><strong>${{ bp.financials.profit_year1_usd | int }}</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Year 2</td><td>${{ bp.financials.revenue_year2_usd | int }}</td><td>${{ bp.financials.costs_year2_usd | int }}</td><td><strong>${{ bp.financials.profit_year2_usd | int }}</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Year 3</td><td>${{ bp.financials.revenue_year3_usd | int }}</td><td>${{ bp.financials.costs_year3_usd | int }}</td><td><strong>${{ bp.financials.profit_year3_usd | int }}</strong></td></tr>
            </table>

            <h4>SWOT Analysis</h4>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div style="background:#f0fdf4; padding:15px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #bbf7d0;">
                    <strong style="color:#16a34a;">STRENGTHS</strong>
                    <ul style="margin:5px 0;">
                        {% for item in bp.swot.strengths %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div style="background:#fef2f2; padding:15px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #fecaca;">
                    <strong style="color:#dc2626;">WEAKNESSES</strong>
                    <ul style="margin:5px 0;">
                        {% for item in bp.swot.weaknesses %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div style="background:#eff6ff; padding:15px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #bfdbfe;">
                    <strong style="color:#2563eb;">OPPORTUNITIES</strong>
                    <ul style="margin:5px 0;">
                        {% for item in bp.swot.opportunities %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div style="background:#fffbeb; padding:15px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #fde68a;">
                    <strong style="color:#d97706;">THREATS</strong>
                    <ul style="margin:5px 0;">
                        {% for item in bp.swot.threats %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 9. Production Plan -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">9. Production Plan</h2>
            <p><strong>Estimated Timeline:</strong> Execution based on supplier lead times ({{ nego.delivery_days }} days).</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Phase 1: Raw Material Import</strong> — Dispatching orders to {{ nego.winner }} & Custom clearance.</li>
                <li><strong>Phase 2: CNC Machining & Casing</strong> — Shaping the {{ specs.material }} framework.</li>
                <li><strong>Phase 3: QA & Testing</strong> — Pressurizing to {{ specs.pressure_bar }} bar to confirm &plusmn; {{ specs.tolerance_mm }} mm tolerances.</li>
                <li><strong>Phase 4: Site Deployment</strong> — Final integration onto industrial pipelines.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 10. Digital Twin & Maintenance -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">10. Digital Twin & Predictive Maintenance</h2>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="grid-2">
                    <div>
                        <p><strong>System Status:</strong> <span class="badge success">Active Monitoring</span></p>
                        <p><strong>Final Health Score:</strong> <span class="text-success" style="font-size:24px;">{{ twin.health_score_final }}%</span></p>
                        <p><strong>Estimated Usable Lifespan:</strong> {{ twin.estimated_lifespan_years }} Years.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p><strong>Next Maintenance Trigger:</strong> <br><span class="highlight">{{ twin.predicted_maintenance_date }}</span></p>
                        <p><strong>Critical Failure Horizon:</strong> <br><span class="highlight">{{ twin.predicted_failure_date }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            {% if twin.alerts|length > 0 %}
            <h4 style="margin-top:20px;">Detected Anomalies (Simulated Sensor Engine)</h4>
            <table class="table-full">
                <tr><th>Time</th><th>Severity</th><th>Metric</th><th>Peak</th><th>Mitigation</th></tr>
                {% for alert in twin.alerts %}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{ alert.date }}</td>
                    <td>
                        {% if alert.severity == 'critical' %}
                        <span class="badge critical">CRITICAL</span>
                        {% else %}
                        <span class="badge" style="background:#f59e0b;">WARNING</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td>{{ alert.type }}</td>
                    <td>{{ alert.value }} (vs {{ alert.threshold }})</td>
                    <td><em>{{ alert.recommended_action }}</em></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </table>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <!-- 11. Media -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">11. Media & Renders</h2>
            <div style="background:#f8fafc; padding:20px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border); text-align:center;">
                <p>Digital previews are available within the secure workspace.</p>
                <a href="{{ video.video_path | default('#') }}" style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; background:var(--secondary); color:#fff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600; margin:10px;">
                    👁️ Watch Generated Video Presentation
                </a>
                <a href="#" style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; background:var(--primary); color:#fff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600; margin:10px;">
                    🧊 View 3D Digital Twin Viewer
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 12. Conclusion -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">12. Executive Conclusion</h2>
            <p><strong>Final Recommendation:</strong> The orchestration pipeline confirms feasibility. It is strongly advised to proceed with establishing the contract with <strong>{{ nego.winner }}</strong> to source the material.</p>
            <p><strong>System Profitability:</strong> Producing this unit generates a {{ bp.financials.margin_percent_year1 }}% operational margin in Year 1. Integrating the Digital Twin sensor net drastically reduces total life-cycle costs via predictive mitigation.</p>
            <div style="background:var(--success); color:#fff; padding:15px; border-radius:8px; text-align:center; font-weight:600; font-size:18px; margin-top:20px;">
                STATUS: APPROVED FOR DEPLOYMENT (INDUSTRIE IA)
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        Generated autonomously by <strong>INDUSTRIE IA</strong> — Local Agentic Pipeline.
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
